// ===== Grammar road: post towns of the old Tōkaidō, grammar points, native example sentences, verb drills =====
// Built by tools/grammar_build.py. Sentences: Tatoeba (tatoeba.org, CC BY 2.0 FR), by native speakers, with sentence
